<title>INDIA: FORECAST-India inflation seen 9.14 pct by year-end.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-India inflation seen 9.14 pct by year-end.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's inflation rate, as measured by the Wholesale Price Index, is seen rising to 9.14 percent by the end of December 1997, a Reuters poll found on Friday.  </p>
<p>The latest figures released by the government showed inflation at 7.75 percent for the week ending January 4.</p>
<p>The following are the projections of 24 leading banks and companies polled by Reuters.</p>
<p>	     FORECASTS FOR THE ANNUAL INFLATION RATE</p>
